
<div class="page-width" style="padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 70px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div class="sy-pill sy-pill-gold" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">THE SUNNYEORA STORY</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #0F172A;">Reimagining Rest & Ergonomics</h1>
