        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #5A626A;">7-10 Days via USPS Priority</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: rgba(229,138,43,0.06); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px;">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 4px;">🛡️</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px;">30-Night Sleep Trial</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #5A626A;">100% Risk-Free Guarantee</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: rgba(124,58,237,0.06); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px;">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 4px;">💬</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px;">24/7 Human Support</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #5A626A;">Replies within 4 hours</div>
